			<div class="content" id="post-content-3876389">
									

<p>Well, i posted my first SCP after being here for 5 years, and for the 4k contest no less! Probably not a good idea to shoot for 4k as a first article but&#8230;I like risks.</p>
<p>I had a total blast writing this, and hopefully you enjoy reading it as much as I did writing it. I got to talk about history, mythology, and crazy secrets, all things I love.</p>
<p>I am very eager to hear everyone's thoughts about this piece, which are hopefully good, but you can think whatever you want.</p>
<p>I would like to thank Countless Skies, and the folks at the SCPDecalssified Discord for their critique and advice.</p>
<p>The first image was created by yours truly, while the other two are under creative commons, they are all linked here:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.scribblemaps.com/maps/view/thing/WeAelIjyt3">https://www.scribblemaps.com/maps/view/thing/WeAelIjyt3</a></p>
<p><a href="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Mohenjodaro_-_view_of_the_stupa_mound.JPG/1280px-Mohenjodaro_-_view_of_the_stupa_mound.JPG">https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Mohenjodaro_-_view_of_the_stupa_mound.JPG/1280px-Mohenjodaro_-_view_of_the_stupa_mound.JPG</a></p>
<p><a href="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/Ottosdal1.jpg">https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/Ottosdal1.jpg</a></p>
<p>Here's some extra info for the curious:</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;+&nbsp;Spoilerz</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;-&nbsp;You&nbsp;have&nbsp;encountered&nbsp;a&nbsp;wild&nbsp;spoiler</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Hopefully the article made it clear, but i would like to clarify some things for anyone who might be confused:</p>
<ul>
<li>SCP-4000 is the earliest incarnation of the foundation, although their link is very small, in a sense SCP-4000 represents the earliest attempt by humans at containing anomalies.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>“Leader” is the administrator, he is immortal and i wanted to take his immortality to an extreme.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>The Foundation is actually his latest and most successful attempt at containing the anomalous</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>The “Bull of Heaven” was in a sense and ancient SCP write-up</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>The fact that there were 13 important people plus the administrator shows that he has a lot of faith in the 13 member council-based leadership system of the Foundation.</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li>A mass containment breach caused the bronze age collapse, it’s cliche, but I couldn't resist lol.</li>
</ul>
<p>There are a lot of little historical/mythological references, hopefully you found them and now feel good about yourself. Cause that mean you know a little bit more about Sumerian history than most people!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>So that's basically it, thanks!</p>
<p>Edit: I made the article more aesthetically pleasing, big thanks to YossiLeiner for the CSS! Also thanks to Sterbai for pointing out a typo to me and reviewing the article!</p>

