<p>While I see your point regarding the imaginary element. It, like several other things in the article hinge on suspension of disbelief, which I clearly broke in your case. So, I'm sorry if it bothers you but I am probably keeping it in cause i think its fun. Albeit I have been aware this whole time that an &quot;imaginary atomic number&quot; is total nonsense and has zero grounding in reality, just did for the kewlness.</p>
